  "schema:comment": "CC-BY-4.0 content licence; no separate code licence for validation scripts, individual skills carry their own tool licences. 92.0% BixBench figure is self-reported, unverified. Single-maintainer, no tagged releases. Powers OmicsHorizon (omicshorizon.ai). Re-verify licence/maturity/benchmark on next review.",
